add('b251','以導軌輪壓啟閉力及幾何查核組立升降門~Erecting lift gates through guide geometry wheel reactions and operating-force checks','採準靜態示意且各工況分開，荷載組合、吊裝與通水程序須依核准工程文件。~Quasi-static examples keep load cases separate; combinations lifting and wet commissioning require approved engineering documents.','敏感度：輪載600kN不變而滾動阻力係數由0.01增為0.03，阻力由6增至18kN；此增量應連結實測輪軸狀態，不能把所有阻力都以同一固定係數涵蓋。~Sensitivity: for a600kN wheel load, increasing the rolling-resistance coefficient from0.01 to0.03 raises resistance from6 to18kN. Relate this change to observed wheel conditions instead of assigning one coefficient to every resistance mechanism.',r'''
矩形門葉靜水力~Rectangular leaf hydrostatic force§平面升降門承受隨深度增加的水壓，合力位置與平均壓力不同，需將荷載傳到輪組或滑塊再送入門槽。以自由水面起算的三角分布只能代表指定工況；兩側都有水或門葉不完全浸沒時，應分別積分並取淨作用。~Pressure on a flat leaf grows with depth and transfers through wheels or slides into guides. A triangular distribution from a free surface represents one specific case. With water on both sides or partial immersion, integrate each pressure field and obtain the net action instead of using full upstream load.§One-sided depth=5 m; width=6 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; force=0.5*9.81*6*5**2=735.75 kN§核對兩側同時水位並以門葉應變與輪載量測比較~Check simultaneous water levels on both sides against leaf strain and wheel-load measurements§漏扣下游水壓會算錯淨力與其作用位置~Omitting downstream pressure misstates net force and its line of action§上游水壓合力永遠就是門葉淨水壓合力~Upstream hydrostatic force always equals the net force on the leaf§0.5*9.81*6*25§735.75
水壓中心與輪載~Pressure center and wheel reactions§三角水壓的作用點位於水面下三分之二水深，支承反力需用力與力矩平衡共同分配。平均分配輪載只有在幾何與剛度對稱且荷載位置匹配時才成立；導軌不平整還會使部分輪失去接觸並集中負荷。~The triangular pressure resultant acts two-thirds of the depth below the surface. Allocate reactions using both force and moment equilibrium. Equal wheel sharing requires compatible geometry, stiffness and load position; uneven guides can unload some wheels and concentrate demand on others.§Triangular pressure depth=6 m; pressureCenterBelowSurface=2*6/3=4 m§量測輪組位置及接觸狀態並以力矩平衡核對反力~Survey wheel positions and contact and reconcile reactions through moment equilibrium§部分輪懸空會把原本均分的反力集中到接觸輪~An unloaded wheel transfers its intended share to the wheels still in contact§水壓合力一定作用在幾何中心深度~The hydrostatic resultant always acts at geometric middepth§2*6/3§4
門槽平行與淨距~Guide parallelism and clearance§導軌間距沿高度的變化會影響門葉行走，局部過窄可能卡阻，過寬則改變輪緣與密封接觸。幾何淨距只是裝配檢查，尚需考慮溫度、受水壓撓曲及施工偏差；不能只量上下兩點就宣稱全行程平行。~Guide spacing along the travel path affects movement. A narrow point can bind while excessive clearance changes flange and seal contact. Geometric clearance is only an assembly check; thermal movement, pressure deflection and local construction deviations require measurements throughout the travel rather than at two endpoints.§GuideClearWidth=6020 mm; movingAssemblyWidth=6008 mm; totalClearance=6020-6008=12 mm§沿全高度分站量測導軌淨距並檢查受荷後變形~Survey guide clearance at multiple elevations and inspect deformation under load§中段局部收窄可能在端點量測正常時仍造成卡門~A local midheight narrowing can bind a gate despite correct endpoint readings§上下端間距相同就保證整條導軌平行~Equal end spacings guarantee parallel guides along the entire path§6020-6008§12
輪組滾動與阻力~Wheel rolling and resistance§輪組應以滾動降低啟閉阻力，但軸承損傷、輪緣摩擦與軌道錯位會引入滑動或偏載。用等效滾動係數只描述已知狀態的總阻力，不能把轉不動的輪仍當正常滾動；要比較輪轉速、行程與驅動負荷。~Wheels reduce operating resistance through rolling, but bearing damage, flange rubbing and misalignment introduce sliding and eccentric load. An equivalent coefficient describes a known state only. A seized wheel cannot still be modeled as normal rolling; compare rotation, travel and drive demand.§totalNormalWheelLoad=600 kN; equivalentRollingCoefficient=0.015; resistance=600*0.015=9 kN§同步量測門葉行程與輪轉數並核對軸承溫度~Compare gate travel with wheel rotation and check bearing temperature§輪停止轉動而門仍移動會造成滑磨與阻力升高~A stationary wheel on a moving gate causes sliding wear and higher resistance§門葉能移動就證明每個輪子正常滾動~Gate movement proves that every wheel is rolling correctly§600*0.015§9
上提力與水動力~Hoisting force and hydraulic load§上提需求包括自重、浮力、密封摩擦及水流造成的上下吸力，項目方向要在同一自由體圖列明。把已知分量代數相加可示範平衡，但動水吸力隨開度與下游邊界改變；不能以空載試車推定所有通水工況。~Hoisting demand includes weight, buoyancy, seal friction and flow-induced vertical force. Show directions in one free-body diagram. Adding prescribed components illustrates equilibrium, while hydrodynamic downpull changes with opening and tailwater. Dry travel tests therefore cannot establish every wet operating condition.§weight=300 kN; buoyancy=40 kN; sealFriction=25 kN; downpull=60 kN; liftDemand=300-40+25+60=345 kN§在不同開度同步記錄吊點力兩側水位及密封接觸~Record lifting force, both water levels and seal contact at several openings§空載運轉正常仍可能在部分開度出現大下吸力~Normal dry operation can coexist with strong downpull at partial opening§空載試車通過就保證所有通水開度啟閉力足夠~Passing dry tests guarantees adequate hoisting force at every wet opening§300-40+25+60§345
雙吊點分載偏心~Twin pick-point eccentricity§雙吊點承受門葉重量與啟閉阻力，荷載偏心使兩側反力不同；剛性平衡模型僅展示幾何影響，鋼索伸長與門葉扭曲還會改變實際分載。安裝應保留兩側獨立荷重與行程訊號，避免只看馬達總電流。~Eccentric load makes twin lifting reactions unequal. A rigid equilibrium model illustrates geometry, while rope stretch and leaf distortion alter actual sharing. Retain separate load and travel measurements for both sides rather than relying on aggregate motor current to detect imbalance.§totalLoad=400 kN; pickSpacing=8 m; loadEccentricity=0.5 m; higherReaction=400*(0.5+0.5/8)=225 kN§比較兩側吊點荷重與門葉傾斜並核對重心位置~Compare pick-point loads and gate tilt against the center-of-mass position§只限制總吊重可能讓單側吊點超載~Limiting only total lifted load can leave one pick point overloaded§雙吊點總載重合格就保證兩側都不超載~An acceptable total load guarantees neither pick point is overloaded§400*(0.5+0.5/8)§225
鋼索彈性與行程~Rope elasticity and travel§鋼索受力伸長會造成兩側行程與捲筒轉數不一致，等效彈性模數需適用所選索構造。線彈性式只處理彈性部分，初期整索壓密、滑移與溫度效應另計；同步控制應以實際門葉位置和負荷驗證。~Rope elongation can decouple gate travel from drum rotation. Effective modulus must match the rope construction. A linear expression covers elastic stretch only, excluding bedding, slip and temperature. Verify synchronization from actual leaf positions and loads rather than drum counts alone.§EquivalentRopeE=80e9 Pa; area=0.001 m2; force=200000 N; length=20 m; elasticExtension=force*length/(area*E)=0.050 m§以門葉位移量測比對捲筒轉數並分辨整索壓密與彈性伸長~Compare leaf displacement with drum rotation and separate rope bedding from elastic stretch§把整索初期壓密當永久幾何誤差可能導致錯誤調整~Treating initial rope bedding as fixed geometry can lead to incorrect adjustment§捲筒轉數相同就保證兩側門葉行程相同~Equal drum rotation guarantees equal gate travel on both sides§200000*20/(0.001*80e9)§0.05
底封接觸與雜物~Bottom seal contact and debris§底封需在門葉就位時形成連續接觸，沉積物與門檻不平整會造成局部縫隙。滲漏孔口式只估已知缺口的水量量級，軟封變形與顆粒沖移會改變面積；應觀察漏水位置與接觸圖，而非只看總漏量。~Bottom seals require continuous contact on seating. Sediment and sill irregularity create local openings. An orifice estimate applies to a prescribed gap, while elastomer deformation and particle movement change its area. Inspect leakage location and contact patterns instead of judging performance by total flow alone.§Assumed defectArea=0.0005 m2; Cd=0.6; head=4 m; leakQ=0.6*0.0005*sqrt(2*9.81*4)=0.00265767 m3/s§定位漏點並比較清除雜物前後的接觸與漏量~Locate leakage and compare contact and flow before and after debris removal§局部硬物頂住底封會使其餘位置無法均勻就位~A hard object beneath the seal prevents uniform seating elsewhere§總漏量小就保證整條底封接觸完整~Low total leakage guarantees complete contact along the bottom seal§0.6*0.0005*math.sqrt(2*9.81*4)§0.0026576681508420123
停止距離與限位~Stopping distance and limits§限位開關與控制系統需考慮訊號延遲及機械減速，停止位置不會等於發出命令的瞬間位置。定減速算例僅是理想運動學，實際煞車能力與負荷方向、摩擦及故障狀態相關；需以核准程序做量測，不能靠猜測保留距離。~Limit systems must account for signal latency and mechanical deceleration. A command position is not the final stop position. Constant-deceleration kinematics is an idealization; brake response varies with load direction, friction and faults and must be measured within an approved test procedure.§speed=0.08 m/s; delay=0.5 s; constantDeceleration=0.16 m/s2; stopDistance=0.08*0.5+0.08**2/(2*0.16)=0.060 m§記錄限位觸發時間實際速度與停止位置並核對重複性~Record limit-trigger time, actual speed and stop position and check repeatability§忽略控制延遲會低估到達硬止擋前所需距離~Ignoring control delay understates distance required before a hard stop§限位訊號一觸發門葉就會立即停止~The leaf stops instantaneously when a limit signal activates§0.08*0.5+0.08**2/(2*0.16)§0.06
洩量率定與交接~Discharge rating and handover§閘門開度不是流量本身，兩側水位、收縮係數與淹沒會共同控制洩量。自由孔流算例只示範特定工況，不適用所有開度與尾水；交接應包含實測率定、位置校正及異常訊號的追查方式，使操作資料與實體閘門一致。~Opening is not discharge: heads, contraction and submergence control the relation. A free-orifice example covers one condition, not every opening or tailwater. Handover should include measured ratings, position calibration and anomaly tracing so operational records correspond to the installed gate.§Assumed free underflow: Cd=0.65; width=4 m; opening=0.5 m; head=3 m; Q=0.65*4*0.5*sqrt(2*9.81*3)=9.97364 m3/s§將實測流量與兩側水位開度共同建立率定表~Build a rating from measured discharge together with opening and both water levels§位置零點錯誤會使小開度洩量產生較大相對偏差~A position-zero error causes larger relative discharge errors at small openings§相同開度不論上下游水位都具有相同流量~The same opening produces the same discharge at every pair of water levels§0.65*4*0.5*math.sqrt(2*9.81*3)§9.97363524498465
''')
add('b252','以接縫變形材料接續與澆置品質形成連續止水~Forming continuous water barriers through joint movement splicing and placement quality','數值均為材料幾何與水量盤點，不能替代止水帶產品試驗、接縫設計與壓力驗證。~Numbers describe geometry and water accounting, not substitutes for product testing joint design and pressure verification.','敏感度：平行板層流缺口由0.20增至0.30mm且其餘條件不變，理想滲流量按三次方增加至3.375倍；實際粗糙接縫、湍流與曲折流路不一定遵守此比例。~Sensitivity: increasing a parallel-plate laminar gap from0.20 to0.30mm at fixed conditions multiplies ideal flow by3.375. Real rough joints, turbulent flow and tortuous paths need not follow this cubic relation.',r'''
水壓高度與接縫~Head pressure and joints§止水帶阻斷收縮縫或施工縫中的連通水路，所承受壓差與實際連通水頭相關。水深乘單位重只給靜水壓量級，不代表接縫任何點都處於同樣壓力；排水、局部缺陷與瞬變需另外辨識，才能確認試驗工況。~Waterstops interrupt connected paths through joints. Differential pressure depends on the connected head, not merely a nearby water level. Depth times unit weight provides a hydrostatic scale; drainage, defects and transients create different local conditions and must be identified before defining a test case.§waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa§對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差~Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head§下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布~Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint§附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差~Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location§35*9.81§343.35
接縫張開與伸長~Joint opening and extension§止水帶需配合接縫張開與剪切，活動區長度決定同樣位移對材料的平均應變。中心泡管可透過幾何變形吸收位移，因此直條拉伸式只示範尺度，不能當所有型式的應變分析；轉角與交叉點通常需單獨檢查。~Waterstops accommodate opening and shear. Active length determines the mean strain for a prescribed displacement, while a center bulb deforms geometrically. A straight-strip estimate illustrates scale rather than every product shape; corners and intersections require separate checks because they constrain deformation differently.§Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless§量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗~Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests§把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變~Using total strip width as active length understates local strain§止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度~Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile§6/80§0.075
溫度收縮與位移~Thermal contraction and movement§混凝土降溫會使接縫張開，但相鄰塊體的約束與溫度分布影響實際位移。自由熱縮量只能提供上限或參考尺度，不能直接等同現場縫寬；監測需同時記錄溫度與接縫位移，分辨季節循環與不可逆變形。~Cooling can open joints, but restraint and temperature distribution govern actual movement. Free thermal contraction supplies a reference scale rather than the installed joint width. Record temperature and displacement together to distinguish seasonal cycling from irreversible change and avoid attributing every movement to temperature alone.§freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m§比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化~Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes§將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動~Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks§自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開~Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field§20*10e-6*15§0.003
焊接接續與搭接~Splice continuity and joining§熱塑止水帶需用適用程序形成連續熔接，金屬或其他材料則需對應接續方式。接合面積乘名義應力只是一項示意，實際接頭的缺口、污染與型式變形會控制失效；應檢查完整剖面而非只看表面接縫漂亮。~Thermoplastic waterstops need qualified fusion procedures, while metal and other materials use different joining methods. Area times nominal stress is illustrative only; notches, contamination and profile deformation can govern failure. Inspect the full section rather than judging the joint by surface appearance alone.§Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa§保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數~Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records§外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔~A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids§接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合~A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section§1800/120§15
定位支撐與覆蓋~Positioning support and cover§止水帶需在澆置期間保持中心位置與足夠埋入深度，偏移會縮短繞流路徑或露出翼緣。幾何覆蓋扣減可示範誤差餘量，但還需考慮轉角和施工接續；支撐方式不可任意穿刺主要止水區造成新滲漏點。~The strip must retain its center and embedment during placement. Displacement shortens bypass paths or exposes ribs. A geometric cover deduction shows tolerance consumption but does not address corners and intersections; supports must avoid puncturing the primary barrier and introducing new leakage paths.§nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm§澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點~Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports§澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙~Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids§澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變~Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting§150-25§125
混凝土包覆與空洞~Concrete encapsulation and voids§止水翼緣周圍混凝土需充分密實，蜂窩會讓水繞過完整材料本體。空洞體積帳只能量化缺陷大小，連通性與位置才決定滲漏路徑；應結合澆置方向、振實可達性與適用檢測，不能以材料出廠合格取代包覆品質。~Concrete must encapsulate the ribs without honeycombing that lets water bypass an intact strip. Void volume measures size, while connectivity and location determine leakage. Combine placement sequence, consolidation access and suitable inspection; product certification does not establish the quality of surrounding concrete.§Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3§檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測~Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately§帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶~Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier§止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水~An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak§0.8*0.04*0.03§0.00096
狹縫層流與敏感度~Slot flow and sensitivity§平行板層流模型顯示縫隙開度對流量有立方影響，細小位移也可能明顯改變滲漏。此式限於光滑平行板、牛頓流體及層流，實際粗糙接縫可能有接觸點與曲折流路；應用它辨識敏感度而非預測未查明裂縫的精確漏量。~Parallel-plate laminar flow has cubic sensitivity to aperture, so small opening changes can strongly affect leakage. The relation assumes smooth parallel walls, a Newtonian fluid and laminar conditions. Rough contacts and tortuous joints violate these assumptions; use it for sensitivity rather than exact leakage prediction.§width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s§比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流~Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability§將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量~Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage§任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律~Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law§0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001)§6.666666666666668e-08
材料膨脹與拘束~Material swelling and restraint§膨潤型材料遇水增大體積，但拘束空間與化學環境會影響密封效果及對混凝土的作用。自由膨脹比不是受拘束壓力，不能由體積直接換算力；需依產品相容性、預膨潤控制與代表性接縫試驗確認適用。~Hydrophilic materials expand in water, but confinement and chemistry control sealing and concrete interaction. Free swelling ratio is not restrained pressure and cannot be converted directly into force. Evaluate compatibility, premature swelling control and representative joint tests using product-specific information.§initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent§比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤~Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion§澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量~Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve§自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力~Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure§(160-100)/100*100§60
分區漏量與定位~Zoned leakage and localization§接縫漏水應分區收集並與水位及溫度同步，總漏量下降可能只是流路轉移而非修補成功。量測容積除時間提供直接流量，但集水效率與暫態蓄水仍需核對；染色或其他定位方法也須符合水質與工程程序。~Collect joint leakage by zone and align it with head and temperature. A lower total may reflect pathway diversion rather than successful repair. Timed volume gives discharge directly, but collection efficiency and transient storage still matter; localization methods must follow the relevant engineering and water-quality procedures.§CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s§以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率~Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency§只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫~A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint§修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉~A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed§18/120§0.15
壓力保持與量測誤差~Pressure holding and measurement error§封閉水路壓力試驗需分辨漏水、溫度與系統柔度造成的壓力變化，壓降不直接等於漏量。若以已率定體積柔度換算，只在小變形且溫度穩定時成立；應保留水溫、補水量及壓力校正，避免單一壓力曲線過度推論。~A pressure-hold test must separate leakage from temperature and system compliance. Pressure drop is not directly a leak rate. Conversion through calibrated volumetric compliance assumes small changes and stable temperature; retain temperature, makeup volume and calibration records before interpreting one pressure trace.§Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption§核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降~Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume§溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失~Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage§壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出~A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked§0.002*15§0.03
''')
add('b253','以分流輸砂磨耗與下游銜接驗證排砂隧道~Verifying sediment bypass through diversion transport abrasion and downstream connection','聚焦繞庫排砂而非任意沖刷壩基，輸砂與磨耗算例為分段簡化且需現地級配驗證。~The focus is sediment bypass rather than arbitrary foundation flushing; simplified transport and abrasion examples need field gradation validation.','敏感度：固定水量40m3/s時含砂質量濃度由3增至5kg/m3，輸砂率由120增至200kg/s，增加66.7%；並不表示相同百分比的河床載砂或磨耗，粗顆粒接觸需另分析。~Sensitivity: at40m3/s, increasing mass concentration from3 to5kg/m3 raises suspended flux from120 to200kg/s, or66.7 percent. Bed load and abrasion do not necessarily increase by the same percentage because coarse-grain contact requires separate analysis.',r'''
分流比與庫區水量~Diversion ratio and reservoir inflow§繞庫隧道在上游分流含砂洪水，將部分水砂送至壩下而減少進庫沉積。水量分流比不等於泥砂分流比，因垂向與橫向濃度可能不均；應同時量測分流前後水量、懸砂與粗粒，避免只以閘門開度推估成效。~A bypass diverts sediment-laden inflow upstream of the reservoir and reconnects downstream. Water diversion fraction is not sediment diversion fraction because concentration varies vertically and laterally. Measure water, suspended sediment and coarse material on both branches rather than inferring performance solely from gate position.§incomingQ=100 m3/s; bypassQ=40 m3/s; waterDiversionFraction=40/100=0.40§同步量測主河與分流口水砂並核對庫區剩餘入流~Measure water and sediment simultaneously in both branches and reconcile residual reservoir inflow§只看水量分流可能高估實際砂量攔截~Water diversion alone can overstate sediment interception§分流四成水就必定分走四成所有粒徑泥砂~Diverting forty percent of water diverts forty percent of every sediment size§40/100§0.4
懸砂質量通量~Suspended sediment mass flux§懸浮泥砂通量由水量與代表性質量濃度相乘，採樣點是否代表整個斷面是關鍵。濁度需現地率定，粗顆粒可能以掃流通過而不在水樣中；質量帳應明確區分懸砂與床載，不能把單一表層水樣當全部輸砂。~Suspended flux equals discharge times representative mass concentration. Sampling must represent the section and turbidity needs local calibration. Coarse bed load may pass outside the water samples, so distinguish suspended and bed-load budgets instead of treating a single surface sample as total transport.§bypassQ=40 m3/s; representativeSSC=3 kg/m3; suspendedFlux=40*3=120 kg/s§以斷面積分採樣比對濁度率定並另記粗粒輸送~Check turbidity against cross-section sampling and document coarse transport separately§表層低濃度水樣會漏估近床高濃度泥砂~A dilute surface sample underestimates concentrated near-bed sediment§一瓶表層水樣能代表全部懸砂與床載~One surface sample represents all suspended sediment and bed load§40*3§120
事件輸砂與效率~Event mass and bypass efficiency§繞庫成效應按洪水事件積分輸砂質量，再與同事件進砂相比。只取峰值濃度乘總水量可能偏差很大，因濃度峰與流量峰未必同步；事件前後暫存砂量也應列入，才能區分真正繞庫與短期堆積。~Evaluate bypass efficiency from event-integrated sediment mass relative to the same incoming event. Peak concentration times total water can be biased because peaks need not coincide. Include temporary storage changes to distinguish successful bypass from sediment merely retained near the intake.§eventIncomingSediment=30000 t; measuredBypassedSediment=21000 t; eventEfficiency=21000/30000*100=70 percent§以同時間窗積分各支流水砂通量並調查分流前池淤積~Integrate branch fluxes over one window and survey intake-pool storage§漏算分流前池暫存會把滯留砂誤當成功繞庫~Ignoring intake-pool storage misclassifies retained sediment as successful bypass§洪峰瞬間效率就等於整場事件效率~Efficiency at the flood peak equals efficiency for the entire event§21000/30000*100§70
隧道自由水面輸送~Free-surface tunnel conveyance§排砂隧道常需高速輸送以減少沉積，但自由水面與滿流邊界必須明確區分。平均速度由有效水深與寬度求得，不能用整個開挖截面代替通水面積；沿程含氣、彎道與頂部餘裕也會影響輸送穩定。~High-speed conveyance can reduce deposition, but free-surface and pressurized boundaries must be distinguished. Calculate mean velocity from actual wetted area rather than the excavated section. Aeration, bends and clearance above the flow also affect stable sediment transport and require separate checks.§Rectangular wetted width=4 m; depth=1.25 m; Q=40 m3/s; velocity=40/(4*1.25)=8 m/s§核對沿程水深速度與含氣厚度並確認未碰頂滿流~Check depth, velocity and aerated thickness along the tunnel and confirm free-surface clearance§誤用開挖面積會低估流速與局部磨耗作用~Using excavation area understates velocity and local abrasion exposure§開挖截面積就是任何工況的通水面積~Excavated area equals wetted area under every flow condition§40/(4*1.25)§8
沉降與行程時間~Settling and transit time§泥砂能否在輸送中沉降取決於沉速與停留時間，同時受紊流懸浮與床面再啟動影響。靜水沉降距離只示範兩種時間尺度，不能預測高速隧道的實際沉積；仍需粒徑分級及近床濃度觀測。~Deposition depends on settling speed and residence time together with turbulent suspension and reentrainment. A still-water settling distance compares time scales but does not predict deposition in a turbulent bypass tunnel. Size fractions and near-bed observations remain necessary to establish transport behavior.§L=1200 m; meanV=8 m/s; prescribedSettlingSpeed=0.01 m/s; settlingDistance=0.01*(1200/8)=1.50 m§比較各粒徑沉速與流行時間並量測近床濃度~Compare size-specific settling speeds with transit time and measure near-bed concentration§忽略紊流再懸浮會把靜水沉降距離誤當實際淤厚~Ignoring turbulent suspension turns settling distance into a false deposition thickness§靜水沉降距離就等於高速隧道實際淤積厚度~Still-water settling distance equals actual deposit thickness in a fast tunnel§0.01*(1200/8)§1.5
床面剪力與啟動~Bed shear and entrainment§床面剪力與顆粒水下重量的比值可作啟動條件尺度，但粗糙、遮蔽、坡度與級配會改變臨界值。示意希爾茲數不能直接指定一個普遍啟動門檻；應以現地粒料與適用實驗比較，並分辨掃流與懸浮。~A Shields parameter compares bed shear with submerged particle weight. Roughness, hiding, slope and gradation alter the critical value, so an illustrative number does not establish a universal entrainment threshold. Compare representative sediment with suitable experiments and distinguish bed load from suspension.§bedShear=20 Pa; sedimentDensity=2650 kg/m3; waterDensity=1000 kg/m3; d=0.010 m; Shields=20/((2650-1000)*9.81*0.010)=0.123560§核對床面剪力估法與粒徑級配並觀察顆粒啟動~Check the shear estimate and gradation and observe particle entrainment§忽略粗粒遮蔽可能高估細粒實際輸移能力~Ignoring hiding by coarse particles can overestimate transport of sheltered fines§單一希爾茲臨界值適用所有坡度與級配~One critical Shields value applies to every slope and gradation§20/(1650*9.81*0.01)§0.12355975658727951
底板磨耗與厚度~Invert abrasion and thickness§粗粒高速接觸底板會產生磨耗，其分布與流束集中、彎道及施工接縫有關。兩次測量差除以期間只給過去平均耗損率，不能自動預報未來壽命；材料改變、事件強度與裸露鋼筋都可能使速率改變。~High-speed coarse particles abrade the invert, especially where jets, bends or joints concentrate contact. Survey difference divided by elapsed exposure gives a past average, not a future life prediction. Material changes, event intensity and reinforcement exposure can alter the rate after the observation period.§MeasuredLoss=12 mm over operatingExposure=300 h; historicalMeanLossRate=12/300=0.040 mm/h§用固定基準重測磨耗圖並按流量與粒徑分組運轉時數~Repeat abrasion surveys on a fixed datum and group exposure by discharge and grain size§用低含砂年度平均率外推高含砂洪水會低估損傷~Extrapolating a low-sediment average into a coarse flood understates damage§歷史平均磨耗率保證未來每小時都相同~Historical mean abrasion rate guarantees identical loss every future hour§12/300§0.04
出口混合與濃度~Outlet mixing and concentration§繞庫出口把含砂水重新接入河道，混合濃度需按水量加權而非兩濃度平均。完全混合假設通常只在足夠距離後合理，近岸高濃度帶與沉降可能主導局部影響；需量測橫斷面與事件持續時間。~The outlet reconnects sediment-laden water to the river. Mixed concentration requires discharge weighting, not a simple concentration average. Complete mixing may occur only farther downstream, while near-bank plumes and settling govern local exposure; measure cross-sections and event duration instead of assuming immediate uniformity.§bypassQ=40 m3/s at3 kg/m3; riverQ=60 m3/s at0.2 kg/m3; fullyMixedSSC=(40*3+60*0.2)/100=1.32 kg/m3§沿下游多斷面採樣並比較橫向混合與沉降變化~Sample several downstream sections and compare lateral mixing and settling§立即套完全混合會低估出口附近局部濃度~Immediate complete-mixing assumptions understate concentration near the outlet§兩股水濃度可以不管流量直接取平均~Two stream concentrations can be averaged without considering their discharges§(40*3+60*0.2)/100§1.32
分流時機與濃度峰~Diversion timing and sediment peaks§洪水的含砂峰可能早於或晚於水量峰，分流時機決定可攔截的砂量與所用水量。用分段質量積分比較時窗能示範取捨，但不構成即時操作指令；實際調度還需洪水安全、下游限制與設備狀態共同核准。~Sediment peaks can precede or follow discharge peaks, making diversion timing important. Piecewise mass integration compares windows and water use but is not a real-time operating instruction. Actual decisions combine flood safety, downstream constraints and equipment state through the approved operating framework.§Two hypothetical intervals:120 kg/s for1800 s and50 kg/s for1800 s; transportedMass=(120+50)*1800/1000=306 t§對齊水量與濃度時序並量化提前或延後時窗的差異~Align discharge and concentration histories and compare earlier and later windows§以洪峰時間取代含砂峰會錯失高濃度時段~Using the water peak as the sediment peak can miss concentrated inflow§水量洪峰與含砂濃度峰永遠同時發生~The water-discharge peak and sediment-concentration peak always coincide§(120+50)*1800/1000§306
水砂守恆與稽核~Water sediment conservation audit§完整排砂評估應讓進砂、出砂與庫內暫存閉合，並將量測不確定度與未量床載分開列出。殘差不是自動等於未量侵蝕，採樣偏差與測深基準也可能造成差額；需要以獨立地形與質量觀測交叉核算。~A complete assessment reconciles incoming, outgoing and stored sediment while separating uncertainty and unmeasured bed load. A residual is not automatically erosion; sampling bias and survey datums can also create imbalance. Cross-check mass records against independent bed surveys and consistent dry-density assumptions.§incomingDryMass=1000 t; bypassed=650 t; otherOutflow=100 t; measuredStorageIncrease=230 t; residual=1000-650-100-230=20 t§用獨立測深與乾密度估算庫存變化再比對通量帳~Estimate storage change from independent bathymetry and dry density and compare flux records§把所有殘差都歸於侵蝕會掩蓋採樣或密度錯誤~Assigning every residual to erosion conceals sampling or density errors§水砂帳殘差一定全部代表未量到的河床侵蝕~Every sediment-budget residual represents unmeasured bed erosion§1000-650-100-230§20
''')
add('b254','以密度差潛入沉降與底孔捕捉解析異重流~Analyzing density currents through plunging settling and low-outlet capture','均勻兩層與稀懸浮算例只呈現尺度，實際異重流受分層地形紊混與粒徑演變控制。~Uniform two-layer dilute-suspension examples illustrate scales; real currents depend on stratification topography mixing and grain-size evolution.','敏感度：水與顆粒密度不變時，體積濃度由0.005增至0.010使密度差與約化重力加倍；固定流深下重力速度尺度增加平方根2倍，並非速度必然加倍。~Sensitivity: at fixed water and grain densities, raising volume concentration from0.005 to0.010 doubles density excess and reduced gravity. At fixed layer depth the gravity-velocity scale rises bysqrt(2), not by a factor of2.',r'''
懸浮濃度與混合密度~Suspension concentration and mixture density§含砂水因顆粒增加體積平均密度而可能沿庫底前進，但鹽度與溫度分層也會改變背景密度。體積濃度不同於每立方公尺混合水的乾砂質量濃度，換算須使用顆粒密度；判斷下潛前應同步量測清水背景與含砂水。~Suspended particles raise mixture density and can drive a bottom current, while temperature and salinity alter ambient density. Volume fraction differs from dry sediment mass per mixture volume and requires grain density for conversion. Measure both ambient and incoming water before inferring plunging behavior.§rhoWater=1000 kg/m3; rhoSediment=2650 kg/m3; volumeFraction=0.01; rhoMix=(1-0.01)*1000+0.01*2650=1016.5 kg/m3§同步採樣顆粒濃度水溫與背景密度並核對濃度定義~Measure sediment concentration, temperature and ambient density together and state concentration definitions§忽略冷暖水密度差會誤判含砂流的浮沉方向~Ignoring thermal density contrast can misidentify whether sediment-laden inflow rises or sinks§只要有泥砂就保證入流一定比任何庫水更重~Any sediment load guarantees inflow denser than all reservoir water§0.99*1000+0.01*2650§1016.5
約化重力與浮力~Reduced gravity and buoyancy§約化重力以密度差相對背景密度縮放重力，表達異重流的浮力驅動尺度。分母選用哪個參考密度須一致，小密度差近似不能任意延伸至高濃度泥流；密度差沿程因捲吸與沉降變化，因此不是固定材料常數。~Reduced gravity scales gravitational acceleration by relative density excess. Use a consistent reference density and do not extend a small-density-difference approximation to dense debris flows. Entrainment and settling change the excess along the route, so reduced gravity is a changing flow property rather than a material constant.§g=9.81 m/s2; currentDensity=1016.5 kg/m3; ambientDensity=1000 kg/m3; reducedG=9.81*(1016.5-1000)/1000=0.161865 m/s2§沿庫底量測密度剖面並比較入流與壩前密度差~Measure density profiles along the bed and compare excess at inflow and near the dam§把入口約化重力固定套全庫會忽略捲吸稀釋~Using inlet reduced gravity throughout the reservoir ignores entrainment dilution§約化重力是一旦決定就不會沿程改變的常數~Reduced gravity cannot change along the current once initially specified§9.81*16.5/1000§0.161865
密度福祿數與流態~Densimetric Froude number and regime§密度福祿數比較流速與層內重力波尺度，有助整理潛入與底流工況。流層厚度須由密度或濃度剖面定義，不能直接用水庫總深；真實前緣與非均勻分層不一定符合均勻兩層模型，需要以觀測檢查。~Densimetric Froude number compares current speed with an internal gravity-wave scale. Define layer thickness from density or concentration profiles rather than total reservoir depth. A real head and nonuniform stratification can depart from the uniform two-layer model, requiring observations before interpreting the number.§V=0.50 m/s; reducedG=0.16 m/s2; layerDepth=2 m; FrD=0.50/sqrt(0.16*2)=0.883883§用密度剖面界定流層厚度並量測流速與前緣位置~Define layer depth from density profiles and measure speed and front position§把全庫深當流層厚度會低估密度福祿數~Using total reservoir depth as current thickness understates densimetric Froude number§異重流厚度一定等於整個水庫的水深~Density-current thickness always equals total reservoir depth§0.5/math.sqrt(0.16*2)§0.8838834764831843
前緣行程與時窗~Front travel and timing window§底流前緣抵達壩前的時間受沿程坡度、捲吸及沉降改變，平均速度只提供第一輪時窗估算。它不是即時開門指令，實際需靠沿庫監測更新；應區分前緣速度與流層內平均速度，兩者不可直接互換。~Front arrival depends on slope, entrainment and settling along the route. A mean-speed estimate supplies an initial time window rather than an operating command. Update it with distributed observations and distinguish front speed from mean velocity within the layer, which need not be equal.§TravelDistance=6000 m; prescribedMeanFrontSpeed=0.4 m/s; arrivalTime=6000/0.4/3600=4.16667 h§以多站濁度及密度到時比對前緣速度並更新抵達區間~Compare arrival times at multiple turbidity and density stations and update the arrival interval§沿程速度改變會使固定時速外推偏離實際到達~Changing speed along the route makes constant-speed arrival forecasts drift§單一平均前緣速度就能精確決定開門時間~One mean front speed determines the exact gate-opening time§6000/0.4/3600§4.166666666666667
沉降時間與粒徑~Settling time and particle size§顆粒沉降會降低底流密度並改變可排出的粒徑組成，沉速受粒徑、形狀、絮凝及濃度影響。指定沉速的距離時間比只表示靜水尺度，紊流再懸浮會延長停留；不同粒徑不能共用一個沉速來預測全部排砂效率。~Settling reduces density and changes the size distribution available for venting. Speed depends on size, shape, flocculation and concentration. Depth divided by prescribed settling speed is a still-water scale; turbulence can extend suspension, and one settling speed cannot represent the efficiency for all fractions.§LayerThickness=3 m; prescribedSettlingSpeed=0.002 m/s; stillWaterSettlingTime=3/0.002/60=25 min§採取分級粒徑與沉降試驗並比較沿程濃度剖面~Test settling by size fraction and compare concentration profiles along the route§用單一細粒沉速代表粗砂會高估粗粒到壩比例~Using a fine-particle speed for coarse sand overestimates coarse arrival at the dam§所有粒徑泥砂都能用同一個沉降速度~Every sediment size can use the same settling velocity§3/0.002/60§25
捲吸稀釋與濃度~Entrainment dilution and concentration§底流捲吸上層清水會增加水量並降低濃度，在無沉降與再侵蝕的短段可用泥砂質量守恆估算。此式不是實際捲吸率模型，捲吸量須另有依據；若床面供砂或沉降顯著，就要補上來源與匯項。~Entrainment increases water volume and dilutes concentration. Over a short reach without deposition or erosion, sediment conservation estimates the resulting concentration. It does not predict entrainment rate, which needs independent evidence; add source and sink terms when the bed exchanges sediment with the flow.§InitialQ=20 m3/s; initialSSC=5 kg/m3; entrainedClearWater=10 m3/s; mixedSSC=20*5/(20+10)=3.33333 kg/m3§以沿程流量與濃度同步量測核對質量是否守恆~Measure flow and concentration along the reach to check sediment mass conservation§忽略床面再侵蝕會把濃度維持誤解為完全沒有捲吸~Ignoring bed erosion can make sustained concentration look like absent entrainment§濃度沒有下降就證明底流沒有捲吸清水~Unchanged concentration proves that the current entrains no clear water§20*5/30§3.3333333333333335
底孔捕捉與排出~Low-outlet capture and export§底孔能否捕捉異重流取決於流層高度、入口位置及抽取範圍，開門流量大不一定全部來自高濃度底層。排出濃度需由水樣量測，不能直接代入壩前最高濃度；應把清水摻入與捕捉效率分開。~Low-outlet capture depends on layer depth, inlet elevation and withdrawal geometry. A large release need not consist entirely of dense bottom water. Measure outlet concentration rather than substituting the maximum near-dam value, and distinguish clear-water dilution from capture efficiency.§OutletQ=15 m3/s; measuredOutletSSC=4 kg/m3; exportedSedimentRate=15*4=60 kg/s§同步量測壩前垂向濃度與出口濃度並檢查抽取層位~Measure vertical concentration near the dam and at the outlet to identify withdrawal depth§入口過高可能主要抽出清水而非底部高濃度流~A high inlet may withdraw mostly clear water instead of the dense bottom layer§底孔開越大就保證每立方公尺排水含砂越高~A wider outlet guarantees more sediment in every cubic metre released§15*4§60
事件排砂效率~Event venting efficiency§排砂效率須明定分母是入庫總砂、抵達壩前底流砂或可捕捉粒徑砂，否則不同研究數值不可比較。事件質量積分比只適用相同起訖時間；殘留在庫底的砂與延後排出的部分需另外列帳，避免雙重計入。~Define whether efficiency uses total incoming sediment, sediment reaching the dam or a capturable size fraction. These denominators produce different metrics. Integrate over matching time windows and separately record retained and delayed export to avoid comparing unlike studies or counting the same sediment twice.§Same-event arrivingCurrentSediment=900 t; exportedThroughOutlet=540 t; arrivalBasedEfficiency=540/900*100=60 percent§先聲明分母範圍再核對進出砂積分與延後排出量~State the denominator scope and reconcile integrated arrival, export and delayed release§混用入庫砂與到壩砂分母會產生無意義的效率比較~Mixing reservoir-inflow and dam-arrival denominators creates meaningless efficiency comparisons§所有排砂效率百分比不需看分母就可互相比較~Every venting-efficiency percentage is comparable without inspecting its denominator§540/900*100§60
下游混合與溶氧~Downstream mixing and dissolved oxygen§底層水可能具有不同溶氧與溫度，排砂成效不能只用移除砂量衡量。瞬時完全混合可估保守水質盤點，但曝氣、耗氧與化學反應會改變下游值；實際應觀測近場與遠場，不能把混合平均當各位置都達標。~Bottom water can differ in oxygen and temperature, so exported sediment is not the only outcome. Instantaneous complete mixing gives a bookkeeping estimate, while reaeration, demand and reactions alter downstream conditions. Observe near and far fields rather than treating the average as compliance everywhere.§No reaction: releaseQ=10 m3/s atDO=2 mg/L; riverQ=30 m3/s atDO=8 mg/L; mixedDO=(10*2+30*8)/40=6.5 mg/L§沿下游斷面量測溶氧與溫度並比較混合前後變化~Measure oxygen and temperature across downstream sections before and after mixing§只量遠場平均會漏掉出口附近低氧帶~A far-field average can miss a low-oxygen plume near the outlet§混合平均溶氧合適就代表所有下游位置相同~An acceptable mixed oxygen average means every downstream location is identical§(10*2+30*8)/40§6.5
底流質量帳與殘留~Current mass budget and residual storage§異重流事件中沉降、再侵蝕與排出同時發生，剩餘質量需由共同時間窗的輸入輸出與床面變化核對。單一差額不會指出砂留在哪裡；需以測深、剖面及採樣確認，並把每項量測的不確定度傳入結果。~During a current event, deposition, erosion and export occur together. Reconcile remaining mass using common-window inputs, outputs and bed change. A residual does not locate stored sediment; bathymetry, profiles and samples must establish where it remains, with uncertainty propagated from each measurement.§incomingMass=1200 t; vented=650 t; otherExport=100 t; remainingNetStorage=1200-650-100=450 t§以事件前後測深及乾密度核對差額並標記未量輸送~Check the residual against before-and-after bathymetry and dry density and flag unmeasured transport§將差額全部放在壩前會忽略沿庫分布沉積~Assigning all residual sediment to the dam front ignores distributed deposition§質量差額可以直接指出沉積物的精確位置~A mass-budget residual directly identifies the exact deposit location§1200-650-100§450
''')
add('b255','串連測深乾砂質量泥漿輸送與回流水的疏浚工程~Connecting bathymetry dry-solids mass slurry transport and return-water management','以指定泥漿均質近似與乾質量帳示意，實際泵送、沉降及環境限制需現地試驗。~Specified homogeneous-slurry and dry-mass examples illustrate bookkeeping; pumping settling and environmental limits require field testing.','敏感度：泥漿流量0.25m3/s不變，固體體積濃度由0.10增至0.15時，固體產率由90增至135m3/h，增加50%；但混合密度與管損同時改變，不能假定泵站功率維持不變。~Sensitivity: at0.25m3/s slurry flow, raising solids volume concentration from0.10 to0.15 increases solids production from90 to135m3/h, or50 percent. Mixture density and losses also change, so pumping power cannot be assumed constant.',r'''
測深網格與挖方~Bathymetric grid and excavation volume§疏浚量以現況與目標底面的差積分，需使用一致水平座標及高程基準。網格平均深度乘面積適用明定分區，陡坡與邊界需更細解析；測量潮位或庫水位補償錯誤可能使整區出現假挖方，應先處理基準再計量。~Dredging volume integrates the difference between existing and target beds in a common coordinate and elevation system. Cell-average thickness works for defined zones, while slopes and edges require finer resolution. Incorrect water-level correction can create false volume across the whole area, so establish datums first.§surveyArea=12000 m2; meanRequiredCut=1.8 m; inSituCutVolume=12000*1.8=21600 m3§以獨立水準控制核對測深基準並加密邊坡與斷面轉折~Check bathymetric datum against independent leveling and refine slopes and section breaks§整區高程偏差會系統性放大或縮小計價挖方~An area-wide elevation bias systematically changes measured excavation volume§網格越多就自動消除高程基準偏差~More survey cells automatically eliminate vertical-datum bias§12000*1.8§21600
乾質量與孔隙~Dry mass and porosity§原位沉積物含有孔隙水，原位體積、固體體積與排出泥漿體積不能混用。乾密度乘原位體積可估乾砂質量，但需代表性的分層樣本；含水量和壓密隨深度變化，單一表層密度不能代表整個開挖厚度。~In-situ deposits contain pore water, so bed volume, solid volume and pumped slurry volume differ. Dry bulk density converts in-situ volume to dry mass only with representative stratified samples. Water content and consolidation vary with depth; one surface density cannot represent the full excavation thickness.§inSituVolume=1000 m3; dryBulkDensity=1300 kg/m3; drySolidsMass=1000*1300/1000=1300 t§分層量測含水量與乾密度並核對採樣代表性~Measure water content and dry bulk density by layer and check sample representativeness§把飽和總密度當乾密度會高估實際移除固體~Using saturated bulk density as dry density overstates removed solids§原位體積與泵送泥漿體積永遠完全相等~In-situ excavation volume always equals pumped slurry volume§1000*1300/1000§1300
泥漿密度與濃度~Slurry density and concentration§混合密度可由水與顆粒密度按體積分率加權，但質量濃度和體積濃度不同。均勻泥漿近似不代表粗粒不會在管底形成高濃度層；密度計需適當校正，並與重量法採樣比對以確認輸砂產率。~Mixture density is volume-weighted from water and grain density, but mass fraction is different from volume fraction. A homogeneous approximation does not exclude near-bed concentration of coarse particles in a pipe. Calibrate the density meter and compare gravimetric samples before calculating production.§rhoWater=1000 kg/m3; rhoSolid=2650 kg/m3; solidsVolumeFraction=0.15; rhoSlurry=0.85*1000+0.15*2650=1247.5 kg/m3§以重量法樣品比對密度計並檢查管線是否分層流動~Compare density readings with gravimetric samples and inspect possible stratified pipe flow§將質量百分比誤當體積百分比會算錯泥漿密度~Confusing mass percentage with volume percentage miscalculates slurry density§固體質量百分比與體積百分比可以直接互換~Solids mass percentage and volume percentage are directly interchangeable§0.85*1000+0.15*2650§1247.5
固體產率與有效工時~Solids production and effective time§泵送總流量包含大量水，真正移除固體的產率需乘固體體積濃度。瞬時高產率不等於班次總量，定位、停機及管線維護降低有效工時；應以時間積分的濃度流量乘積計算，避免把各自平均值任意相乘。~Pumped flow includes water, so solid production requires solids fraction. A high instantaneous rate does not equal shift output because positioning, downtime and maintenance reduce productive time. Integrate concentration times discharge over time instead of automatically multiplying unrelated averages from different periods.§slurryQ=0.25 m3/s; solidsVolumeFraction=0.15; solidsProduction=0.25*0.15*3600=135 m3/h§同步記錄流量濃度與有效抽泥時段並核對總乾質量~Record flow, concentration and productive periods together and reconcile total dry mass§以名牌泵量乘整班時間會高估實際抽除量~Nameplate flow multiplied by the whole shift overstates actual removal§泵的總流量就是固體泥砂的移除流量~Total pump flow equals the removed solid-sediment flow§0.25*0.15*3600§135
管徑流速與沉積~Pipe diameter velocity and deposition§輸送管流速須與泥砂沉降及磨耗共同考量，過低易沉積，過高則增加能耗與磨損。連續方程只給平均速度，不提供沉積臨界值；臨界輸送需依粒徑、濃度與管徑試驗，不能套用一個通用最低速度。~Pipeline speed must balance deposition, energy and wear. Continuity provides mean speed but not a critical deposition threshold. The required transport condition depends on size, concentration and diameter and needs suitable testing; one universal minimum velocity cannot cover every slurry.§slurryQ=0.25 m3/s; pipeDiameter=0.30 m; meanV=0.25/(pi*0.30**2/4)=3.53678 m/s§比較流速管壓與停機後沉積跡象並核對泥砂級配~Compare velocity and pipe pressure with postshutdown deposits and sediment gradation§低速停留會形成砂床並使再次啟動阻力增加~Low-speed residence creates a bed that raises restart resistance§只要管內有流動就不可能發生泥砂沉積~Any pipe flow makes sediment deposition impossible§0.25/(math.pi*0.3**2/4)§3.53677651315323
泵送水頭與功率~Pumping head and power§泥漿泵需克服高差、沿程及局部損失，軸功率還受泵效率影響。用指定總水頭與混合密度估功率只是工況點的盤點，實際泵曲線會因含砂濃度改變；吸入條件、氣體與磨損也可能限制可用性能。~A slurry pump overcomes elevation and distributed and local losses, with shaft demand depending on efficiency. Prescribed total head and density define one operating estimate; solids change the pump curve. Suction conditions, air and wear can limit performance beyond the nominal power calculation.§rhoSlurry=1250 kg/m3; Q=0.25 m3/s; totalHead=30 m; efficiency=0.70; shaftPower=1250*9.81*0.25*30/0.70/1000=131.384 kW§核對泵進出口壓差實際流量及電力並記錄泥漿密度~Check pressure rise, actual flow and electrical input alongside slurry density§用清水效率代表高濃度泥漿可能低估軸功率~Applying clear-water efficiency to concentrated slurry can understate shaft power§清水泵曲線在任何含砂濃度下完全不變~A clear-water pump curve stays unchanged at every solids concentration§1250*9.81*0.25*30/0.70/1000§131.38392857142858
沉澱面積與表面負荷~Settling area and surface loading§沉澱池以表面負荷比較水流通過速度與顆粒沉速，理想離散沉降假設忽略短流、絮凝與再懸浮。面積估算不能取代停留時間分布與出水試驗；水流入口擾動及污泥堆積會降低實際有效區域。~Surface loading compares throughput with settling speed under ideal discrete-settling assumptions. Short-circuiting, flocculation and resuspension violate that idealization. Area estimation does not replace residence-time and effluent tests, and inlet disturbances or sludge accumulation reduce the effective settling region.§returnWaterQ=0.20 m3/s; basinSurfaceArea=500 m2; surfaceLoading=0.20/500=0.00040 m/s§以示蹤或流場觀測檢查短流並比較進出水粒徑濃度~Check short-circuiting by tracer or flow observation and compare inlet-outlet sediment sizes and concentrations§入口噴流直達出口會使名義面積無法充分利用~An inlet jet reaching the outlet bypasses much of the nominal settling area§沉澱池面積足夠就保證所有顆粒完全沉降~Adequate nominal basin area guarantees complete settling of every particle§0.20/500§0.0004
脫水質量與處置~Dewatering mass and handling§脫水把固體濃縮以利運輸處置，但泥餅仍含水，濕重不能直接等於移除乾砂。以乾質量守恆換算泥餅重量須明示固含率是質量分率；實際體積還需濕密度，並考慮材料性質及核准處置途徑。~Dewatering concentrates solids for handling, but cake still contains water. Wet mass is not removed dry sediment. Convert using dry-mass conservation with an explicit mass-based solids fraction; cake volume additionally needs wet density and must fit material characteristics and the approved handling route.§drySolids=100 t; cakeSolidsMassFraction=0.60; wetCakeMass=100/0.60=166.667 t§以乾燥樣品核對泥餅固含率並與運輸地磅質量對帳~Verify cake solids by drying samples and reconcile weighbridge records§把泥餅濕重全算成乾砂會高估疏浚成效~Counting all wet cake as dry sediment overstates dredging performance§泥餅重量就是已移除的乾固體重量~Cake mass equals the mass of dry solids removed§100/0.60§166.66666666666669
回流水濃度與通量~Return-water concentration and flux§回流水可能攜帶細粒返回庫區或下游，濃度與總水量共同決定返回質量。單次低濃度不代表事件負荷低，長時間排水仍可能累積顯著通量；應依核准監測點量測背景與排放，分辨自然混濁和作業增量。~Return water can carry fines back to the reservoir or downstream. Concentration and volume together determine returned mass. A low spot concentration does not establish a low event load because sustained flow accumulates mass; monitor background and discharge at approved locations to distinguish operational increments.§returnQ=0.20 m3/s; SSC=100 mg/L=0.10 kg/m3; duration=3600 s; returnedDryMass=0.20*0.10*3600=72 kg§以同步流量與濃度積分計算回流負荷並比較上游背景~Integrate paired flow and concentration for return load and compare upstream background§只報最低瞬時濃度會掩蓋總排放質量~Reporting the lowest instantaneous concentration hides the total returned mass§瞬間濃度低就保證整場回流泥砂量很少~A low instantaneous concentration guarantees a small total return load§0.2*0.1*3600§72
復測容積與淨成效~Resurveyed capacity and net benefit§疏浚完成後需用同基準復測確認有效容量增加，挖出量不一定全部轉為可用庫容，邊坡回淤與施工外擴都會影響結果。淨增量須扣除同期沉積並列不確定度；長期成效還取決於後續入砂率與維護策略。~Postdredging surveys on the same datum establish useful capacity gain. Excavated volume does not all become usable storage because slope adjustment and redeposition intervene. Account for concurrent sedimentation and uncertainty; long-term benefit also depends on future sediment input and maintenance rather than one completion survey.§ExcavatedInSituVolume=22000 m3; measuredRedeposition=2500 m3; netStorageGain=22000-2500=19500 m3§以同一水位基準復測庫容並獨立估算施工期再淤量~Resurvey capacity on a common datum and independently estimate deposition during the works§只用外運量宣稱可用庫容會忽略庫內回淤與邊坡調整~Claiming useful storage from hauled quantity ignores redeposition and slope adjustment§外運泥砂體積必定等於新增可用水庫容量~Hauled sediment volume must equal newly usable reservoir capacity§22000-2500§19500
''')
